 r"I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Consultant position at Oliver Wyman in London. I completed an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London in September 2026, where a distinction is expected, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I currently work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. Across my academic and professional experience I have taken unclear client and business problems, structured them, tested what was actually true, and turned the result into recommendations people could act on. I am particularly interested in this role because that is the core of consulting.",

